<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5995] ODBC: SQLGetData gets data for the next row instead of current</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5995</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;SQLGetData&lt;/tt&gt; when called after &lt;tt&gt;SQLFetch&lt;/tt&gt; should retrieve data from the same row as &lt;tt&gt;SQLFetch&lt;/tt&gt;. But currently, &lt;tt&gt;SQLGetData&lt;/tt&gt; retrieves data from the next row.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13093194">IGNITE-5995</key>
